--- !u!114 &633246659
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 633246655}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6daecdcf36140468ea63f5b9d474b1ef, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguelist:
  - 'This giant tea kettle is full and empty. Empty and full. Fully empty? Emptily
    full? '
  - ...
  - 'How full is your heart? Mine is full of tea. Heh. '
  - "But tea...tea smells nice. But it doesn\u2019t taste like its smell. It tastes
    like old, moldy grass. I was told it was good. But I don\u2019t really get it. "
  - "A Mad hatter who doesn\u2019t like tea?!? No way!!! "
  - 'But at the bottom of every heart of tea, there must be a tea bag once full of
    flowers, which would have become a disintegrated mess by now. '
  - 'Why did we have to drink the flowers? '
  name: 'Mad Hatter '
  effectlist: 03000000030000000300000003000000030000000300000003000000
